  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/blob/ca466b5a572a867de79ba9077e6445265b841c96/data/api/client-server/pusher.yaml#L237\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\nThe `format` parameter in `PusherData` is documented as\r\n\r\n> Currently the only format available is 'event_id_only'.\r\n\r\nThis is confusing because while `event_id_only` is the only allowed value for `format`, the parameter is optional and omitting it sends a lot more than just the event ID which arguably could be called a \"format\" of its own.",
